      "title": "3 catalysts that could drive Nvidia stock higher in 2026",
      "description": "<p>The Chinese government tells tech companies to prep their Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) H200 chip orders, according to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-01-23/china-tells-alibaba-top-tech-firms-to-prep-nvidia-h200-orders\">Bloomberg</a>. Bernstein managing director and senior analyst Stacy Rasgon \u2014 who has a Buy rating on Nvidia \u2014 reacts to the headline and compares the supply-demand dynamic for chips in China.</p>\n<p>Catch Stacy Rasgon also <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/intels-lip-bu-tan-making-205400064.html\">weigh in on the leadership</a> of Intel (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/INTC\">INTC</a>) CEO Lip-Bu Tan.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
      "summary": "The Chinese government tells tech companies to prep their Nvidia (NVDA) H200 chip orders, according to Bloomberg. Bernstein managing director and senior analyst Stacy Rasgon \u2014 who has a Buy rating on Nvidia \u2014 reacts to the headline and compares the supply-demand dynamic for chips in China. Catch Stacy Rasgon also weigh in on the leadership of Intel (INTC) CEO Lip-Bu Tan. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
